) . '/assets/media/products/appennino/product-08.webp'); ?>" aria-label="水浸夏季黑松露片 · 350 g 视频 2"><source data-src="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/products/videos/refresh-19905887.mp4'); ?>" type="video/mp4"></video></div><div class="lux-product-video-notes"><p>水浸松露片适合先沥去多余水分，再根据菜式加入油脂或酱汁。这样可以由厨房自行决定整体风味的浓淡，不必让保存液决定成菜的口感。</p><p>想保留明显的松露形态时可以使用整片，需要均匀入味时可以切碎。两种处理方式都适合在主体料理完成后进行，让松露风味留在最后的组合里。</p></div><div class="lux-product-storage-gallery"><picture><source media="(max-width: 720px)" srcset="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/products/storage/truffle-01-mobile.webp'); ?>"><img width="1200" height="675" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/products/storage/truffle-01.webp'); ?>" alt="水浸夏季黑松露片 · 350 g · 料理应用参考 1"></picture><picture><source media="(max-width: 720px)" srcset="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/products/storage/truffle-02-mobile.webp'); ?>"><img width="1200" height="675" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/products/storage/truffle-02.webp'); ?>" alt="水浸夏季黑松露片 · 350 g · 料理应用参考 2"></picture><picture><source media="(max-width: 720px)" srcset="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/products/storage/truffle-03-mobile.webp'); ?>"><img width="1200" height="675" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/products/storage/truffle-03.webp'); ?>" alt="水浸夏季黑松露片 · 350 g · 料理应用参考 3"></picture><picture><source media="(max-width: 720px)" srcset="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/products/storage/truffle-04-mobile.webp'); ?>"><img width="1200" height="675" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/products/storage/truffle-04.webp'); ?>" alt="水浸夏季黑松露片 · 350 g · 料理应用参考 4"></picture